<string name="action_rotate_left">Rotate Left</string><string name="action_settings">Settings</string><string name="settings_options">Options</string><string name="settings_help">Help</string><string name="report_github">Report Issue on GitHub</string><string name="options_title">Thumbnail Image Size</string><string name="options_size_s">Small (S)</string><string name="options_size_m">Medium (M)</string><string name="options_size_l">Large (L)</string><string name="options_desc">Select thumbnail image size (S/M/L).</string><string name="help_title">App Guide &amp; Help</string><string name="help_overview_title">1. Overview</string><string name="help_overview_text">Mihiraki PDF Utility supports 14 languages, page reordering, spread view (RTL/LTR), deleting, rotating, splitting, margin cropping, metadata/password settings, diagnostics, and local audit logs.</string><string name="help_open_title">2. Opening &amp; Saving PDFs</string><string name="help_open_text">Tap the Open icon (or Ctrl+O) to load a PDF. Use Save (Ctrl+S) to save all pages, or Export Selected (Ctrl+E) to save selected pages.</string><string name="help_page_ops_title">3. Page Operations</string><string name="help_page_ops_text">Tap pages to select them. When pages are selected, the top toolbar buttons automatically switch from general controls (Save, Add, Settings) to page editing actions (Rotate, Move, Split, Insert Blank, Delete, Export Selected).</string><string name="help_display_title">4. Display Modes &amp; Devices</string><string name="help_display_text">Toggle between Grid and Spread views. Use Toggle RTL to switch between Right-to-Left (RTL) and Left-to-Right (LTR) reading directions (manga/books). Optimized for smartphones, tablets, and ChromeOS.</string><string name="help_settings_title">5. Settings, Diagnostics &amp; Support</string><string name="help_settings_text">From the settings menu (gear icon or support heart button), you can configure and view properties, password, options, version, help, diagnostics, and support items.</string><string name="action_owned">Owned</string><string name="diagnostics_endurance_title">Long-Running Stress Test</string><string name="diagnostics_endurance_desc">Select test duration and run continuous stress tests including 14-manga merge, 1100-page 9x append, editing stress, rotation, and foldable simulation.</string><string name="endurance_progress_text">Progress: Elapsed %1$d min / Target %2$d min</string><string name="endurance_iteration_text">Iteration: #%1$d</string><string name="endurance_course_text">Current Course: %1$s</string><string name="endurance_memory_text">Memory Usage: %1$d MB</string><string name="endurance_pattern_select">Test Course &amp; Pattern Selection:</string><string name="endurance_stop_test">Stop Test</string><string name="endurance_start_test">Start Test (%1$d min)</string><string name="download_all_test_files">Download All Test PDFs &amp; Samples</string><string name="cancel_download">Cancel Download</string><string name="endurance_running_banner">⚡ [Endurance Test Running] Elapsed: %1$d min / Target: %2$d min (#%3$d)</string><string name="endurance_stop_button">Stop</string><string name="processing_pdf_message">Processing &amp; merging PDF files…\nPlease wait.</string><string name="course_option_all">All Courses (Patterns 1–10)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_1">Pattern 1 (Multi-File Merge)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_2">Pattern 2 (1100p Append 9x)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_3">Pattern 3 (Merge + Editing Stress)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_4">Pattern 4 (Append + Editing Stress)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_5">Pattern 5 (Merge + Screen Rotation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_6">Pattern 6 (Append + Screen Rotation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_7">Pattern 7 (Merge + Foldable Simulation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_8">Pattern 8 (Append + Foldable Simulation)</string><string 